1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,876
For years,
he served the emperor

2
00:00:02,876 --> 00:00:05,120
in his palace
in Addis Ababa.

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,060
They called him the
honey wine server.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:13,650
He knew how to pour without
spilling a single drop.

5
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:20,100
And he knew how to disappear
quietly into the room.

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,443
One night,
at a formal gathering,

7
00:00:25,443 --> 00:00:28,210
guests filled
the long tables.

8
00:00:29,192 --> 00:00:33,292
A guest asked whether the
emperor even knew his name.

9
00:00:35,192 --> 00:00:39,582
He lowered his eyes in
silence, and said nothing.

10
00:00:42,192 --> 00:00:44,948
The great emperor
set down his

11
00:00:44,948 --> 00:00:47,612
glass and asked
for his name.

12
00:00:49,192 --> 00:00:52,361
Hearing Tesfaye,
he raised a toast,

13
00:00:52,361 --> 00:00:55,982
and the whole hall
lifted their glasses.

14
00:00:57,192 --> 00:00:59,511
My grandmother said he spent

15
00:00:59,511 --> 00:01:01,912
his life serving
the emperor.

16
00:01:03,192 --> 00:01:05,687
But that night,
for one moment,

17
00:01:05,687 --> 00:01:09,712
the whole room remembered
the man behind the tray.

